      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_b79f8c93",
      "@type": "OverallIntent",
      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: meme_file_name; hasOverallIntent: hateful; overall-intent-description: The image depicts a Black man with a menacing expression, juxtaposed with text that reads 'i found jesus in prison' and 'i raped that mexican hard.' This combination is intentionally provocative and hateful, leveraging racial stereotypes (associating Blackness with criminality and violence) and anti-Latino stereotypes (implying Mexican women are targets of sexual violence). The meme uses the visual of a Black man to imply he is a violent criminal, while the text explicitly promotes racist and misogynistic violence against a Latino person. The overall intent is to spread hate and reinforce harmful racial and ethnic stereotypes through shock value and violent imagery.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_4775fd48"
      },
      "extractionMethod": "llm_extraction_huggingface"
    },
