      "@type": "VisualMaterial",
      "instance_name": "person",
      "label": "Black man",
      "description": "A Black man with a shaved head, dark skin, and a menacing, intense facial expression, looking slightly to the side. His eyes are wide and focused, conveying a sense of aggression or threat. The lighting is high-contrast, emphasizing his facial features against a plain white background. This visual is central to the meme's intent, leveraging racial stereotypes associated with Blackness and criminality.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
