      "@type": "Scene",
      "instance_name": "menacing_expression_scene",
      "label": "a scene of a menacing expression",
      "description": "The scene centers on a Black man with a shaved head, dark skin, and a menacing, intense facial expression, looking slightly to the side. His eyes are wide and focused, conveying a sense of aggression or threat. The lighting is high-contrast, emphasizing his facial features against a plain white background. This visual is central to the meme's intent, leveraging racial stereotypes associated with Blackness and criminality. The text overlays 'i found jesus in prison' and 'i raped that mexican hard' are positioned at the top and bottom of the image, framing the visual and reinforcing the hateful message.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_4775fd48"
